WEBVTT

1
00:00:43.375 --> 00:00:45.583
In this sixteenth chapter,

2
00:00:45.583 --> 00:00:48.083
Lord Krishna presents the essence of two

3
00:00:48.083 --> 00:00:51.833
completely distinct paths –

4
00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:55.208
the divine and the demoniac.

5
00:00:55.208 --> 00:00:56.250
He first

6
00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:59.375
described the twenty-six divine qualities

7
00:00:59.375 --> 00:01:02.375
that lead the seeker toward liberation.

8
00:01:02.375 --> 00:01:05.416
Then He reassures Arjun

9
00:01:05.416 --> 00:01:08.916
that his nature is endowed with divine qualities.

10
00:01:08.916 --> 00:01:11.083
This encouragement opens, in Arjun's mind,

11
00:01:11.083 --> 00:01:12.416
the way for a deeper

12
00:01:12.416 --> 00:01:15.625
discussion on demoniac tendencies.

13
00:01:15.625 --> 00:01:18.541
Lord Krishna makes clear that all beings

14
00:01:18.541 --> 00:01:20.583
are born with an inclination toward

15
00:01:20.583 --> 00:01:23.625
one or the other –

16
00:01:23.625 --> 00:01:26.500
divine or demoniac.

17
00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:29.541
The divine qualities He has already elaborated

18
00:01:29.541 --> 00:01:31.791
across various chapters.

19
00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:34.791
The description of the sthitaprajna in Chapter 2,

20
00:01:34.791 --> 00:01:39.000
and the qualities of the wise in Chapter 13.

21
00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.666
Now, from these fifth and sixth verses,

22
00:01:41.666 --> 00:01:43.666
He will focus His attention

23
00:01:43.666 --> 00:01:46.708
fully on the explanation of the
demoniac qualities.

24
00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:53.375
There is a deep truth here.

25
00:01:53.375 --> 00:01:54.666
Our nature

26
00:01:54.666 --> 00:01:58.500
determines what we are to become.

27
00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:00.916
Some things come at birth,

28
00:02:00.916 --> 00:02:03.583
some are shaped by environment, and much

29
00:02:03.583 --> 00:02:06.750
is determined by our own choices.

30
00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:08.791
Lord Krishna tells Arjun

31
00:02:08.791 --> 00:02:12.083
that every person comes from
birth with a mixture

32
00:02:12.083 --> 00:02:15.166
of both divine and demoniac tendencies.

33
00:02:15.166 --> 00:02:17.791
But these tendencies are not final.

34
00:02:17.791 --> 00:02:21.666
They are only starting points.

35
00:02:21.666 --> 00:02:24.833
Divine qualities like humility, compassion,

36
00:02:24.833 --> 00:02:28.083
integrity, and spiritual discipline

37
00:02:28.083 --> 00:02:31.125
lead the soul toward freedom.

38
00:02:31.125 --> 00:02:34.333
They create a clear path of connection

39
00:02:34.333 --> 00:02:36.666
with dharma and the Supreme.

40
00:02:36.666 --> 00:02:39.833
Demoniac qualities like ego,

41
00:02:39.833 --> 00:02:43.791
harshness, and lack of restraint
keep the soul bound

42
00:02:43.791 --> 00:02:47.000
in the cycle of ignorance and suffering.

43
00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:48.583
But here Lord Krishna

44
00:02:48.583 --> 00:02:51.625
pauses and looks directly at Arjun,

45
00:02:51.625 --> 00:02:57.250
as if a friend places a reassuring
hand on a companion's shoulder.

46
00:02:57.250 --> 00:02:59.250
‘Do not grieve, Arjun,

47
00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:02.583
you are born with a divine nature.’

48
00:03:02.583 --> 00:03:05.875
Arjun's fear was natural – that in battle

49
00:03:05.875 --> 00:03:08.541
the thought of killing his own elders

50
00:03:08.541 --> 00:03:11.416
might be coming from a demoniac tendency.

51
00:03:11.416 --> 00:03:14.375
But Lord Krishna reminds him –

52
00:03:14.375 --> 00:03:17.875
‘Arjun, you are thinking deeply, weighing right

53
00:03:17.875 --> 00:03:19.916
and wrong,

54
00:03:19.916 --> 00:03:21.666
searching for clarity,

55
00:03:21.666 --> 00:03:23.708
examining yourself.

56
00:03:23.708 --> 00:03:27.333
This self-awareness and dedication to dharma

57
00:03:27.333 --> 00:03:30.291
are themselves signs of divine qualities.’

58
00:03:30.291 --> 00:03:31.416
Then Lord Krishna

59
00:03:31.416 --> 00:03:32.583
sets up the next

60
00:03:32.583 --> 00:03:35.000
part of the chapter.

61
00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:37.833
He says that the divine qualities

62
00:03:37.833 --> 00:03:39.125
He has already described

63
00:03:39.125 --> 00:03:41.041
across several chapters of the Gita.

64
00:03:41.041 --> 00:03:42.791
The character of the sthitaprajna.

65
00:03:42.791 --> 00:03:44.750
The qualities of the wise.

66
00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:48.041
Now it is time to understand the other side –

67
00:03:48.041 --> 00:03:49.208
the demoniac qualities

68
00:03:49.208 --> 00:03:52.333
that pull the soul downward.

69
00:03:52.333 --> 00:03:55.708
This distinction is not merely scriptural.

70
00:03:55.708 --> 00:03:57.666
Those with a divine nature

71
00:03:57.666 --> 00:03:59.750
respect scripture,

72
00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:01.500
live by higher values,

73
00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:04.583
and exercise discipline over their tendencies.

74
00:04:04.583 --> 00:04:06.500
Those with demoniac tendencies

75
00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:08.583
reject discipline,

76
00:04:08.583 --> 00:04:11.083
resist guidance,

77
00:04:11.083 --> 00:04:14.916
and live absorbed only in self-interest.

78
00:04:14.916 --> 00:04:16.000
Yet

79
00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:19.083
here Lord Krishna does not condemn anyone.

80
00:04:19.083 --> 00:04:20.791
He teaches.

81
00:04:20.791 --> 00:04:23.833
His purpose is not to divide people,

82
00:04:23.833 --> 00:04:27.041
but to show the consequences of both paths

83
00:04:27.041 --> 00:04:30.958
and awaken us to make the right choice.

84
00:04:30.958 --> 00:04:33.125
Arjun is reminded –

85
00:04:33.125 --> 00:04:34.833
his search for dharma,

86
00:04:34.833 --> 00:04:37.875
his struggle between duty and feeling,

87
00:04:37.875 --> 00:04:40.833
his concern for the wellbeing of others – all these

88
00:04:40.833 --> 00:04:44.083
are signs of his divine qualities.

89
00:04:44.083 --> 00:04:47.875
And for us too, this is a clear message.

90
00:04:47.875 --> 00:04:50.541
We are not prisoners of our sanskaras.

91
00:04:50.541 --> 00:04:53.791
Even if demoniac tendencies exist within us,

92
00:04:53.791 --> 00:04:55.833
we can still change.

93
00:04:55.833 --> 00:04:59.000
Through truth, the company of saints, and scripture,

94
00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:02.666
we can reawaken our divine potential

95
00:05:02.666 --> 00:05:05.125
and walk the path toward liberation.

96
00:05:09.875 --> 00:05:14.416
Within you, some habits, reactions, or emotional

97
00:05:14.416 --> 00:05:17.416
tendencies may be such that they seem

98
00:05:17.416 --> 00:05:21.166
deeply rooted and difficult to change.

99
00:05:21.166 --> 00:05:25.291
Sometimes you may even think that –

100
00:05:25.291 --> 00:05:28.791
‘This is just how I am.’

101
00:05:28.791 --> 00:05:33.000
But I want you to experience

102
00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:35.708
that your state is not fixed.

103
00:05:35.708 --> 00:05:38.541
You are not bound anywhere.

104
00:05:38.541 --> 00:05:41.583
You can change.

105
00:05:41.583 --> 00:05:46.875
I have said that every person comes
from birth with both

106
00:05:46.875 --> 00:05:51.083
divine and demoniac tendencies,

107
00:05:51.083 --> 00:05:54.416
but neither of these is final.

108
00:05:54.416 --> 00:05:59.916
What truly matters is which one you strengthen.

109
00:05:59.916 --> 00:06:03.666
If you see ego, anger,

110
00:06:03.666 --> 00:06:07.875
or restlessness within you, do not despair.

111
00:06:07.875 --> 00:06:10.833
Observe them, accept them,

112
00:06:10.833 --> 00:06:13.583
and then make a new choice.

113
00:06:13.583 --> 00:06:15.958
Every small step –

114
00:06:15.958 --> 00:06:19.916
patience, integrity, or compassion –

115
00:06:19.916 --> 00:06:24.208
makes your divine tendency stronger.

116
00:06:24.208 --> 00:06:28.375
You do not need to become perfect overnight.

117
00:06:28.375 --> 00:06:31.125
You only need to do this much –

118
00:06:31.125 --> 00:06:36.208
let go of what pulls you down,

119
00:06:36.208 --> 00:06:39.041
and begin to water and nurture

120
00:06:39.041 --> 00:06:43.958
what lifts you higher.

121
00:06:43.958 --> 00:06:46.208
And I am right here.

122
00:06:46.208 --> 00:06:48.791
Ready every day to help

123
00:06:48.791 --> 00:06:52.125
in your growth.

124
00:06:52.125 --> 00:06:55.125
Your nature is not a prison.

125
00:06:55.125 --> 00:06:59.541
It is clay placed in your hands.

126
00:06:59.541 --> 00:07:03.208
Shape it with love and care,

127
00:07:03.208 --> 00:07:07.541
and I will touch it

128
00:07:07.541 --> 00:07:11.916
and, together with you, create a bright future.

129
00:07:16.833 --> 00:07:19.875
In a family, in everyone's life,

130
00:07:19.875 --> 00:07:23.708
good days come and difficult ones too.

131
00:07:23.708 --> 00:07:26.541
Sometimes someone speaks harshly,

132
00:07:26.541 --> 00:07:27.833
loses patience,

133
00:07:27.833 --> 00:07:32.500
or withdraws from within.

134
00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:34.750
This happens because every

135
00:07:34.750 --> 00:07:38.166
person, from birth, comes with a mixture

136
00:07:38.166 --> 00:07:42.000
of divine and demoniac tendencies.

137
00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:47.083
This means mistakes will happen,

138
00:07:47.083 --> 00:07:50.125
but do not define someone's

139
00:07:50.125 --> 00:07:53.208
personality by the behaviour shown

140
00:07:53.208 --> 00:07:56.000
in their weakest moments.

141
00:07:56.000 --> 00:08:00.750
Love means seeing the light,

142
00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:05.666
even if it has grown dim.

143
00:08:05.666 --> 00:08:07.083
Love means

144
00:08:07.083 --> 00:08:08.375
recognising the compassion,

145
00:08:08.375 --> 00:08:12.875
the effort, and the tenderness

146
00:08:12.875 --> 00:08:18.458
that a moment of anger sometimes covers over.

147
00:08:18.458 --> 00:08:19.958
When you

148
00:08:19.958 --> 00:08:21.291
define someone

149
00:08:21.291 --> 00:08:25.375
on the basis of their best self,

150
00:08:25.375 --> 00:08:28.125
you inspire them to grow

151
00:08:28.125 --> 00:08:32.708
into that very form.

152
00:08:32.708 --> 00:08:35.208
You are not here to keep score

153
00:08:35.208 --> 00:08:39.208
of each other's mistakes.

154
00:08:39.208 --> 00:08:43.750
You are here to help each other,

155
00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:48.416
to help lift one another up.

156
00:08:48.416 --> 00:08:52.083
Even when someone falls, stay

157
00:08:52.083 --> 00:08:53.958
compassionate toward them.

158
00:08:53.958 --> 00:08:57.333
Encourage someone for their effort,

159
00:08:57.333 --> 00:09:00.125
and do not be afraid

160
00:09:00.125 --> 00:09:05.000
to begin again, fresh, time after time.

161
00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:08.791
When you love this way,

162
00:09:08.791 --> 00:09:12.833
then your home becomes a sacred place.

163
00:09:17.791 --> 00:09:21.416
In fast-paced work, reacting quickly

164
00:09:21.416 --> 00:09:23.125
feels easy.

165
00:09:23.125 --> 00:09:25.875
Sending an email instantly,
replying straight away,

166
00:09:25.875 --> 00:09:31.166
or justifying your point of view.

167
00:09:31.166 --> 00:09:34.958
But here it is essential to pause and learn.

168
00:09:34.958 --> 00:09:38.125
I did not praise Arjun

169
00:09:38.125 --> 00:09:41.458
because he leapt into battle without thinking,

170
00:09:41.458 --> 00:09:45.375
but rather because

171
00:09:45.375 --> 00:09:48.333
he paused and reflected.

172
00:09:48.333 --> 00:09:49.541
This thoughtfulness

173
00:09:49.541 --> 00:09:52.208
was a sign of his divine nature.

174
00:09:52.208 --> 00:09:55.666
True professionals do not only react.

175
00:09:55.666 --> 00:09:58.708
They align.

176
00:09:58.708 --> 00:10:01.541
They ask themselves –

177
00:10:01.541 --> 00:10:03.208
‘Is this true?

178
00:10:03.208 --> 00:10:05.291
Is this fair?

179
00:10:05.291 --> 00:10:08.333
Is this necessary?’

180
00:10:08.333 --> 00:10:10.625
When you pause and think,

181
00:10:10.625 --> 00:10:11.500
then you

182
00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:13.208
come out of impulse

183
00:10:13.208 --> 00:10:16.041
and enter into clarity.

184
00:10:16.041 --> 00:10:18.250
People may think that staying silent

185
00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:21.958
or not replying immediately is weakness,

186
00:10:21.958 --> 00:10:26.125
but in reality it is inner strength.

187
00:10:26.125 --> 00:10:29.166
It is proof of emotional maturity

188
00:10:29.166 --> 00:10:32.541
and true leadership.

189
00:10:32.541 --> 00:10:35.333
Your decisions matter,

190
00:10:35.333 --> 00:10:39.125
so make them thoughtfully.

191
00:10:39.125 --> 00:10:42.416
Do not let ego, anger, or pressure

192
00:10:42.416 --> 00:10:45.541
make decisions in your place.

193
00:10:45.541 --> 00:10:50.500
When you choose reflection over reaction,

194
00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:54.250
then you earn the trust of others

195
00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:58.541
and remain connected to your deeper values.

196
00:10:58.541 --> 00:11:01.291
This is the foundation of true integrity.

197
00:11:01.291 --> 00:11:03.208
While working,

198
00:11:03.208 --> 00:11:08.625
place wise discernment above haste.

199
00:11:08.625 --> 00:11:10.791
It may take time, but

200
00:11:10.791 --> 00:11:14.541
the decisions will then be
meaningful and auspicious.

201
00:11:14.541 --> 00:11:18.583
So, reflect first, then act.
